        "func": "// Extract data from the chart node output\nlet chartData = msg.payload[0].data[0]; // Access the array of data points\nlet formattedData = \"\";\n\n// Loop through each data point and format it\nchartData.forEach((point) => {\n    let timestamp = new Date(point.x).toISOString(); // Convert timestamp to a readable format\n    let temperature = point.y; // Extract the temperature value\n    formattedData += `${timestamp}, ${temperature}\\n`; // Format as a string\n});\n\n// Set the formatted data as the payload\nmsg.payload = formattedData;\nreturn msg;",
